player cards for 35 hours (#331 \u2192 #348) because no static check knew and the visual suite still photographed the module's standalone shell \u2014 hence class prefixes plus check-module-styles.mjs in CI."}, {"id": "module_draft_persistence", "label": "Turn in progress through host.saveDraft/loadDraft", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/new-scoring-module/SKILL.md", "source_location": "## 4. The screen", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "1000 Sabords' Kotlin ancestor kept its dice in module-level vars and a reload threw away the hand a player had just counted out; the module also stores the event log rather than a mutable aggregate so the reducer's output never depends on who else holds a reference."}, {"id": "apps_scoreo_src_modules_registry", "label": "apps/scoreo/src/modules/registry.ts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/skills/new-scoring-module/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_claude_skills_new_scoring_module_skill_new_scoring_module", "target": "doc_technical_module_contract", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/new-scoring-module/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_new_scoring_module_skill_new_scoring_module", "target": "module_bundle_trap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/new-scoring-module/SKILL.md", "source_location": "## 2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_new_scoring_module_skill_new_scoring_module", "target": "module_style_leak_trap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".claude/skills/new-scoring-module/SKILL.md", "source_location": "## 5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_claude_skills_new_scoring_mod